            "review_title": "Review at Brauhof Saigon",
            "review_text": "Tuyến K\n1 contribution\n0\nThe German Beer Restaurant 1.\nJun 2026 • Friends\nLast Friday night, I and a friend visited Brauhof Saigon after accidentally seeing a restaurant on Facebook because there was a music show so I came to try.\nLocated in Vinhomes Ba Son, the hotel is a villa with a European orientation. Everything is comfortable, well-rounded but still creating a very comfortable feeling. The air is right spirit beerhouse, people communicate very fun, it is free from a rugged, discreet, very open and fun vibe. Whoever walks out here is throwing the roof.\nI personally prefer the black beer because it is delicious and impresses me when I drink it for the first time. Food, vibe of food, each person will have different flavors so I don't comment good or not, but with a restaurant in District 1, the portion of food is too high quality, because eating full and the price deserves it always ✔️\nIn terms of service, the staff are very friendly even though there are quite many guests.\nOverall, the restaurant gives a feeling like a German beer house but is still very \"saigon\" fun and enough to make me want to go back.\nNext time in June, the staff will introduce you if you have the opportunity, you should join a group of 8 people because there is a huge roasted meat combo program. I would like to be here on Saturday, so happy guys.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten June 13, 2026",
